#AMAZONAS.S3M
Amazonas
1992
Channels : @10@
Playing time : @2:43@
$- This song is dedicated to the Amazonian rain forests.
$Currently they are being cut down at an alarming rate.
$Mankind does not know what it actually is losing by
doing this.
#CAPTURED.S3M
Space Hulk I: Captured Sun
1992
Channels : @8@
Playing time: @3:36@
$- Very traditional, Laser Dance -style pop/disco beat
$music. Sometimes I tend to call it 'Deep Space Traffic
Theme'. Listen to it and find out why...
#MANGROVE.S3M
Mangrove
1993
Channels : @5@
Playing time: @2:38@
$- Sometimes you just get inspired by weird subjects.
$This swampy, reggae-ish tune was inspired by a TV
document about manrgove swamps! Don't ask why...
#MERCRAIN.S3M
Mercury Rain
1994
Channels : @8@
Playing time : @4:24@
$- History in the making - as history repeats. Very
$long and repetitive tune, which feels like its name.
$A good suggestion is to listen to it while you
work on something else. It's meant for the background.
#ID.S3M
ID
1993
Channels : @5@
Playing time: @2:23@
$- ID, a Freudian concept, is the center of instincts
$and desires in the human brain. I still believe it
$controls people much more than we think. Think about
the things drugs can do to your life before trying any.
#RAMAGARD.S3M
Rama Gardens
1993
Channels : @8@
Playing time : @4:46@
$- This tune has been inspired by several sources,
$but mainly by a SciFi book written by Arthur C.
$Clarke. Generally it's dance beat and new age
music mixed.
#WAR-REM.S3M
War in the Middle Earth - Remix
1994
Channels : @9@
Playing time : @4:41@
$- Ispired by the stories written by J.R.R. Tolkien.
$The song is a remix of a tune I made much earlier
$with a Sound Blaster. The stereo effects and samples
were bad, and I wanted to make an improved version.
#CRYSTAL.S3M
Crystal Dragon
1992
Channels : @12@
Playing time: @2:11@
$- This oversized tune was inspired by... money! There
